  "faqQ1": "How do I change a dose time?",
  "faqA1": "Open your Schedule or Medication tab, tap the specific medication card, select Edit Schedule, and adjust your dosage alerts. Changes sync instantly across caregiver devices.",
  "faqQ2": "Why didn't I get a reminder?",
  "faqA2": "Ensure battery optimization is disabled for MedRemind in phone Settings. Also verify that Critical Alerts and notification permissions are granted in your operating system settings.",
  "faqQ3": "How do caregiver alerts work?",
  "faqA3": "Caregivers receive silent affirmations when medicines are logged. If a crucial dose is missed for over 30 minutes, an escalated notification is automatically sent to the primary caregiver.",
  "faqQ4": "How do I add a family member?",
  "faqA4": "Go to Profiles, tap Add, then send an invite by email or phone. They accept the link to connect.",

